@fact isolde.names
# en: She remembers every student's name, and every student's mistakes.
text [00ea88] = 她记得每个学生的名字，也记得每个学生犯过的错。

@fact isolde.portrait
# en: As a student she set the observatory on fire twice. Her portrait from those days is hidden in a forgotten corridor.
text [389493] = 她当学生时，两次把观星台点着了。那时的肖像被藏在一条被遗忘的走廊里。

@fact isolde.chess
# en: She plays tower chess by her window and laughs, short and delighted, when she loses.
text [29f019] = 她在窗边下水晶塔棋，输了的时候会短促而愉快地笑出声。

@fact isolde.thread
# en: She has been following the same thread you have: the seal beneath the lake is weakening.
text [db9906] = 她一直在追查和你同一条线索：湖底的封印正在变弱。
# en: Follow the Hollow Star into your final year.
hint [b1551e] = 追查空洞之星，直到最后一年。

@fact isolde.mercy
# en: She asks students what they think is just, and sometimes she listens.
text [d24034] = 她会问学生，他们认为怎样才算公正——有时，她会听。
# en: Call at the Headmistress's Tower in your second year.
hint [27ba47] = 第二年时去院长塔拜访。

@fact isolde.vrell
# en: She knows the name Absalom Vrell: expelled long before her time, and still in the ledger, crossed out.
text [d5c518] = 她知道阿布萨隆·弗雷尔这个名字：早在她的时代之前就被开除了，名字还留在名册上，被划掉了。
# en: Beat the Outcast in the Whisperwood, and keep his grimoire.
hint [2ae832] = 在低语森林打败放逐者，留下他的魔典。

@fact isolde.really
# en: She asks how your term is going, and then how it is really going, and waits for the second answer.
text [d71be9] = 她会问你这学期过得怎么样，再问你“真正”过得怎么样，然后等着第二个回答。
# en: Visit the Headmistress's Tower, once its owl lets you up.
hint [5053a1] = 等石鸮放你上楼后，去院长塔。
